 * optional: an omitted field means "leave unchanged" (same partial-update
 * contract as `UpdateQuestionRequest` in `questions.ts`). Unlike a
 * question's `sectionId`, no field here needs the `""`-clears-to-NULL
 * sentinel — a section's own title/description are never cleared to null,
 * only ever replaced with a new (possibly empty) string.
